
<%doc>

=head1 NAME 

/search/forms/bac_tab.mas - a mason module to display the BAC search form.

=head1 AUTHOR

Lukas Mueller <lam87@cornell.edu>. Based on Perl code by Rob Buels.

=cut 

</%doc>

<%perl>

use CXGN::Genomic::Search::Clone;

my $q    = $ARGS{q};

$q ||= CXGN::Genomic::Search::Clone->new->new_query;

</%perl>

  <table class="search_form_title" summary=""><tr><td>
    <span class="search_form_title">Pesquisa de clones genômicos</span>
  </td><td align="right">
    <a class="search_form_random" href="/maps/physical/clone_info.pl?random=yes">
    Selecionar um clone genômico aleatoriamente
    </a>
  </td></tr></table>

<form action="/maps/physical/clone_search.pl" method="get">
  <div class="indentedcontent">
      <% $q->to_html %>
    <h3>Links relacionados:</h3>
    <ul>
    <li><a href="/maps/physical/list_bacs_by_plate.pl">Consultar BACs por placa Overgo</a></li>
    <li><a href="/cview/map.pl?map_id=1&amp;physical=1">Sobre mapeamento físico</a></li>
    <li><a href="/maps/physical/overgo_stats.pl">Projeto Overgo</a></li>
    <li><a href="/maps/physical/overgo_process_explained.pl">Processo de plaqueamento Overgo</a></li>
    <li><a href="http://www.genome.arizona.edu/fpc/tomato/">Mapa FPC do tomate no AGI</a></li>
    <li><a href="/supplement/plantcell-14-1441/bac_annotation.pl">Anotação antiga (2000) de BACs do cromossomo 6 do tomate</a></li>
    <li><a href="/solanaceae-project/seed_bac_selection.pl">Diretrizes para seleção de BACs-semente</a></li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</form>




